<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Token-Efficient Prompt Injection Attack: Provoking Cessation in LLM Reasoning via Adaptive Token Compression</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Yu Cui
</span><span id="id1" class="ltx_note ltx_note_frontmatter ltx_thanks_funding ltx_role_thanks"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">†</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">†</sup><span class="ltx_note_type">thanks: </span>Work done during internship at UC Merced NLP Lab.</span></span></span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
